        <item>
            <title>Download Full Installer 6.1.3</title>
    		<description><![CDATA[
			<h3>What's New in Download Full Installer 6.1.3</h3>
			<ul>
				<li>Fix missing alerts:
				<ul>
					<li>max. concurrent downloads</li>
					<li>can't create installer app</li>
				</ul>
				<li>Save latest app window size</li>
			</ul>
			<h3>What's New in Download Full Installer 6.1.2</h3>
			<ul>
				<li>Add the DMG file size to legacy download cards</li>
				<li>Add an informational alert when there is insufficient free space</li>
			</ul>
			<h3>What's New in Download Full Installer 6.1.1</h3>
			<ul>
				<li>Lower the target to macOS 13.5</li>
			</ul>
			<h3>What's New in Download Full Installer 6.1.0</h3>
			<ul>
				<li>Lower the target to macOS 14.6</li>
				<li>Add support for High Sierra, Mojave and Catalina installers</li>
				<li>Replace bundled Sparkle.framework with the Sparkle SPM package</li>
				<li>Remove app sandboxing environment</li>
			</ul>
			]]></description>
